<title>USA: Financial Bancorp seeks share buyback.</title>
<headline>Financial Bancorp seeks share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LONG ISLAND CITY, N.Y. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday that it is seeking regulatory approval for the repurchase of an additional five percent of the company's shares, or 89,531 common shares.</p>
<p>The bank holding company said it completed a stock buyback program of 93,668 shares last month.</p>
<p>Financial Bancorp, which presently has 1,790,622 shares outstanding, said it filed an application with the Office of Thrift Supervision to get approval for the stock repurchase program.</p>
